## Data Model Check - render.vm
## Source: widgets/dmCheck/src/render.vm. tools/build-widget.py inlines the shared snippets (shared/vm) at the
## BW_SHARED markers and shared/js/core.js + graph.js at the BW_INLINE_JS marker, checks the result with
## Velocity 1.4 and writes widgets/dmCheck/dist/dmCheck.zip.
## Velocity 1.4 dialect (guide 3.1.9): no map literals, one statement per line, no backslashes in strings.
## Model pipeline as dmDefine (dm-read, dm-yaml, dm-model); checks in dm-check.vm (SPECIFICATION K3-K5, K15, K16).
#set($bwVersion = "0.1.0")
## BW_SHARED style.vm
<style>
  .dc-head { margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .dc-sum { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 14px; margin: 4px 0 6px 0; }
  .dc-chip { border: 1px solid rgb(215,220,230); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1px 10px; background: rgb(250,251,253); }
  .dc-error { color: rgb(198,40,40); font-weight: 600; }
  .dc-warning { color: rgb(170,105,0); font-weight: 600; }
  .dc-info { color: rgb(51,103,214); font-weight: 600; }
  .dc-ok { color: rgb(26,127,55); font-weight: 600; }
  .dc-probs { border: 1px solid rgb(230,200,200); background: rgb(253,247,247); padding: 4px 8px; margin-bottom: 6px; max-height: 160px; overflow: auto; }
  .dc-h { font-weight: 600; margin: 10px 0 2px 0; }
  .dc-static td, .dc-static th { font-size: 11px; }
  .dc-filter { width: 220px; }
</style>

## ======================================================================= model and checks
## BW_SHARED dm-read.vm
## BW_SHARED dm-yaml.vm
## BW_SHARED dm-model.vm
